       \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  16% (13/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  18% (14/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  19% (15/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  20% (16/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  22% (17/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  23% (18/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  24% (19/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  25% (20/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  27% (21/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  28% (22/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  29% (23/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  31% (24/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  32% (25/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  33% (26/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  35% (27/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  36% (28/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  37% (29/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  38% (30/77)        \r\nremote: Compressing objects:  40% (31/77)        \r\nremote:\n<truncated 12116 bytes>\n10. tambahkan fitur login dengan google\n\n<summary>\n### 1. Task Overview\n- **User Request**: \"tambahkan fitur login dengan google\" (Implement Google Sign-In for adult accounts—parents and teachers, matching PRD FR-AUTH-01).\n- **Scope & Boundaries**:\n  - Children **never** register with personal data or Google accounts (per NFR-SC-01 / FR-AUTH-01; they only use PIN 4-digit + Family/Class Code).\n  - Adult accounts (parents/teachers) must be able to sign in or register with Google OAuth 2.0 without disrupting existing email/password authentication.\n  - Must provide a robust implementation that supports real Google Cloud Console credentials (`GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` & `GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET`) and a built-in one-click demo fallback so judges/evaluators can test the flow immediately even before configuring Google Cloud.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Progress\n- **Completed in Recent Steps**:\n  - **Prisma Schema Updated** ([`prisma/schema.prisma`](file:///e:/codekids/prisma/schema.prisma)):\n    - Made `passwordHash` optional (`String?`) in `model User`.\n    - Added `googleId String? @unique` and `image String?` for profile avatars.\n  - **Production Deployment on Dokploy (Previous Fixes)**:\n    - Fixed `npm ci` failure in Nixpacks: added `@emnapi/core` & `@emnapi/runtime` to top-level `package.json` & lockfile, updated `vitest` to v3 for Node 20 compatibility.\n    - Added `binaryTargets = [\"native\", \"debian-openssl-3.0.x\", \"linux-musl-openssl-3.0.x\"]` in Prisma schema.\n    - Configured auto `prisma db push` on `npm run start` in `package.json`.\n    - Fixed hydration error in Web Speech API with `useSpeechSupported()` hook.\n    - Updated Gemini model fallback (`gemini-3.5-flash`, `gemini-3.1-flash-lite`, `gemini-flash-latest`) and curriculum hints fallback.\n- **In Progress (Current Turn)**:\n  - Designing and implementing Google OAuth 2.0 API routes (`/api/auth/google`, `/api/auth/callback/google`, `/api/auth/google/demo`) and frontend UI components in `/akun/masuk` and `/akun/daftar`.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings & Decisions\n- **Session Architecture**:\n  - `src/lib/session.ts` uses signed JWT cookies (`jose`) with `createAdultSession(userId, role: \"PARENT\" | \"TEACHER\")`.\n  - Google OAuth simply needs to create or find the user in `db.user`, then call `await createAdultSession(user.id, user.role)` and redirect to `/dashboard`.\n- **Role & Family Code Generation**:\n  - If a new user signs up with Google as `PARENT`, generate a unique 6-character `familyCode` using `randomCode(6)` from `src/lib/codes.ts` (same pattern used in `src/app/akun/actions.ts`).\n  - Google users have `emailVerified: new Date()`, bypassing email verification steps.\n- **Password Auth Compatibility**:\n  - In `src/app/akun/actions.ts`: `login()` compares passwords. If `user.passwordHash` is null, handle gracefully: `return { error: \"Akun ini terdaftar dengan Google. Silakan masuk menggunakan tombol Google.\" }`.\n- **Redirect URI Configuration**:\n  - Format: `${baseUrl}/api/auth/callback/google`\n  - Determine `baseUrl` dynamically from `process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL` or `req.headers` (`http://localhost:3000` locally or `https://peserta39.m1sec.my.id` on Dokploy).\n\n---\n\n### 4. Active Context\n- **Workspace**: `e:\\codekids`\n- **Current Git Branch**: `Main` (Capital M, tracked on `origin/Main`).\n- **Target URL**: `https://peserta39.m1sec.my.id` (Dokploy deployment).\n- **Environment**: Next.js 16 (App Router), React 19, Prisma SQLite `dev.db`, Tailwind CSS v4.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Next Steps\n1. **Apply Prisma Schema Change**:\n   - Run `npx.cmd prisma db push` to update SQLite schema for `passwordHash String?`, `googleId`, and `image`.\n2. **Create Google OAuth Route Handlers**:\n   - Create `src/app/api/auth/google/route.ts`:\n     - Checks `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID`. If present, redirects to `https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/v2/auth` with `client_id`, `redirect_uri`, `scope=openid email profile`, and encoded `state` (containing role & CSRF nonce).\n     - If `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` is missing, redirects to `/api/auth/google/demo` or handles demo mode.\n   - Create `src/app/api/auth/callback/google/route.ts`:\n     - Handles OAuth code exchange with `https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token`.\n     - Fetches profile info from `https://www.googleapis.com/oauth2/v3/userinfo`.\n     - Finds user by `googleId` or `email`. If exists, updates `image` and logs in. If new, generates `familyCode` (if PARENT) and creates user record.\n     - Calls `createAdultSession(user.id, user.role)` and redirects to `/dashboard`.\n   - Create `src/app/api/auth/google/demo/route.ts`:\n     - Creates or logs in a demo Google user (`budi.google@gmail.com`) for immediate evaluation if real Google API keys are not yet added.\n3. **Update UI in `/akun/masuk` & `/akun/daftar`**:\n   - Add a sleek \"Masuk dengan Google\" / \"Daftar dengan Google\" button with the official Google 'G' SVG icon.\n   - Add a clean `\"atau\"` divider between Google login and email/password form.\n   - Pass `role` query param from `/akun/daftar` so Google knows whether the registrant is `PARENT` or `TEACHER`.\n4. **Update `src/app/akun/actions.ts`**:\n   - Add safe check: if `!user.passwordHash`, prompt user to log in via Google button.\n5. **Update `.env` and `.env.example`**:\n   - Document `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` and `GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET`.\n6. **Verify and Deploy**:\n   - Run `npm.cmd run typecheck` and `npm.cmd run build`.\n   - Commit and push to `Main` for Dokploy deployment.\n\n---\n\n### 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- Must not alter the child login mechanism (children never use Google, only PIN + family/class code).\n- Keep existing email/password auth fully functional alongside Google login.\n</summary>\n\n# Conversation Logs\nStart with the compact transcript; if a step has `truncated_fields`, read only that specific line in `transcript_full.jsonl`:\n- `<appDataDir>/brain/<conversation-id>/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl`\n- `<appDataDir>/brain/<conversation-id>/.system_generated/logs/transcript_full.jsonl`"}
